   "source": [
    "# Empirical Bayes\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "In empirical Bayes we want to estimate a prior from population.\n",
    "\n",
    "$\\hat p(z) \\approx p(z)$\n",
    "\n",
    "## Problem\n",
    "\n",
    "$z$ - probability of an event occuring. \n",
    "$p(z) = Beta(\\alpha, \\beta)$.\n",
    "\n",
    "$x$ - observed number of times an event occured. \n",
    "$p(x\\mid z) = Binomial(N, z)$ "
   ]
